          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Order of Higher Techno-Arcana: Skitariiax-Primus" hidden="false" id="af8a-97fa-015e-0d2d">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Order of Higher Techno-Arcana: Skitariiax-Primus" id="0505-4332-dfc8-b912" hidden="false">
                  <description>Only an Archmagos Prime may select this Order. It gains the Skitariiax-Protectorate and Data Inviolate special rules.
Data Inviolate. When choosing Datasphere Uplink Protocols before the battle, select two different Protocols instead of one. You may activate both during the battle, but not in the same Game Turn.
Skitariiax-Protectorate. The Archmagos Prime gains Datasphere Uplink, Command Node, Feel No Pain (5+) and the Skitarii Sub-type. Its Detachment's Compulsory Troops choices must be Skitarii Ranger Cohorts or Skitarii Vanguard Cohorts. Triaros Armoured Conveyors and Tech-Priest Auxilia in the Detachment gain Datasphere Uplink.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <costs>
                <cost name="Pts" typeId="d2ee-04cb-5f8a-2642" value="0"/>
              </costs>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
