                <rule name="Under Hunter Killer, the Arcuitor may instead be joined by a Cyber-Carnivora Pack, a Domitar Battle-Automata Maniple or a Sarumiat Battle-Automata Maniple" id="32aa-7775-657a-9f21" hidden="false">
                  <description>Under Hunter Killer, the Arcuitor may instead be joined by a Cyber-Carnivora Pack, a Domitar Battle-Automata Maniple (*Liber Mechanicum*, page 31) or a Sarumiat Battle-Automata Maniple (Normal cost of the unit).</description>
                </rule>
