            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The model gains It Will Not Die (5+).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Supercharged Reactor" hidden="false" id="061f-a73d-d85b-7a8a">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Supercharged Reactor" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="b095-76af-7f5b-d90e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Once per game, the model may fire all its weapons twice in the controlling player's Shooting phase, at the same target or two different ones, resolving the attacks one after the other. Afterwards it suffers D3 Hull Points of damage with no saves or Damage Mitigation rolls allowed, and may not fire any ranged weapons until the end of the controlling player's next Game Turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Broad-Spectrum Data-Tether" hidden="false" id="8107-b774-cf59-96a7">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Broad-Spectrum Data-Tether" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="437a-5afb-c150-a926">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">Friendly models with Datasphere Uplink within 12" of the bearer add 1 to their Leadership, to a maximum of 10. This does not stack with any other data-tether.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Enhanced Data-Tether" hidden="false" id="0208-f7ee-1a0d-2401">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Enhanced Data-Tether" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="6155-edd3-f7b5-cf1b">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">All models in the bearer's unit add 1 to their Leadership, to a maximum of 10. This does not stack with any other data-tether.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Corpuscarii Electoo" hidden="false" id="4a06-34fc-0934-651b">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Corpuscarii Electoo" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="0b92-a9d4-f134-7869">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">All attacks made by the model gain Overload (6+).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Fulgurite Electoo" hidden="false" id="0130-78b2-7a40-f09c">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Fulgurite Electoo" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="b25f-0af9-a6e0-cc27">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The model's melee attacks gain Disruption (6+). If a unit containing a model with this electoo destroys an enemy unit in close combat, including by Sweeping Advance, all of that unit's voltagheist fields give a 3+ Invulnerable Save for the rest of the battle. If several units with this electoo fight in the same combat, resolve each unit's attacks separately so you know which one earned the bonus.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="f58e-77bf-01e8-616c" hidden="false" targetId="0fc2-757c-fd37-2526" type="rule">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Invulnerable Save (3+)"/>
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
    </selectionEntry>
    <selectionEntry type="upgrade" import="true" name="Atomantic Pulse Reactor" hidden="false" id="8f00-280e-b8bb-dae5">
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Atomantic Pulse Reactor" typeId="2a1f-7837-f0ef-be44" typeName="Wargear Item" hidden="false" id="4108-e39d-0890-823e">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The model has a 5+ Invulnerable Save. When it loses its last Wound or Hull Point, before it is removed or replaced with a Wreck, every model within 6+D6", friendly or enemy, suffers a hit at Strength 7+D3, AP4, measured from the model's hull. Every unit hit must take a Pinning test (only one per explosion).</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Invulnerable Save (X)" id="5159-5a5d-b3c8-97fd" hidden="false" targetId="0fc2-757c-fd37-2526" type="rule">
          <modifiers>
            <modifier type="set" field="name" value="Invulnerable Save (5+)"/>
          </modifiers>
        </infoLink>
      </infoLinks>
